<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African insider trading report due Thursday.</title>
<headline>S.African insider trading report due Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa will release its report on insider trading on Thursday, Deputy Finance Minister Gill Marcus said on Tuesday, introducing the Financial Institutions Amendment Bill in the national assembly.</p>
<p>It is the first of 22 bills planned this year to tighten up the regulation and supervision of the country's financial services.</p>
<p>-- Parliamentary newsroom +27 21 403-2502</p>
</text>
